flowchart TD
  A[Service owner proposes route] --> B[Provide contract and ownership]
  B --> C[Gateway reviews public path and method]
  C --> D[Security reviews auth and destination]
  D --> E[Define schema, limits, timeout and quota]
  E --> F[Add contract and negative tests]
  F --> G{All approvals and tests pass?}
  G -->|No| H[Return for changes]
  H --> B
  G -->|Yes| I[Approve route configuration]
  I --> J[Verify in staging]
  J --> K[Activate through controlled release]
